==Central Franconian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|gmw-cfr|ziehn}} {{i|southern Moselle Franconian}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|goh|gmw-cfr}} {{m|goh|zehan}}. The vocalic development is comparable to that in {{m|gmw-cfr|sehn||to see}}, i.e. Old High German ''-eha-'' was contracted and merged with ''-ia-'' (see the same in {{etyl|nl|-}} {{m|nl|tien}}, {{m|nl|zien}}).

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/tseːn/|lang=gmw-cfr}}

